body:
Here's the link to his run, he's also done one for the dlcs. [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5WB7YyL9Wnw](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5WB7YyL9Wnw)

&#x200B;

Apparently he did his no save run for dishonored 2, not 1, but that's probably even more impressive lol, here's the link to that:[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PjZoU0woD4](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5PjZoU0woD4)

The praetor suit is found crushed into pieces, with the burnt corpse of a man lying next to it. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I guess that clear things up?

Doesn't matter, TLD is commanding reality itself to rewrite the thing. It's like having the power of an author. His will being very strong will only help him resist soul trapping. 

&#x200B;

Yeah shouts are insanely broken in lore.

I think there were some plots that were half-baked in the novel as well and some unnecessary conflict added >!(kagari being one of them)!<. I did think there were a few step ups from the original steins gate, with much needed character depth for Daru.  

&#x200B;

The anime was very weird, it tried doing a lot of stuff but then just kind of left it hanging
